\par\par \b \uc2  MOF Usui-Japan took  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  action overseas on Wed. \b0\par\par\uc2 201 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2000\par 04:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, March 9 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary authorities \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in overseas \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading on Wednesday, Vice Finance Minister Nobuaki Usui told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  Bankers said the Bank of Japan (BOJ) bought euros for yen in European trading hours on Wednesday, but did not put its euro purchase orders through the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , meaning it would have acted alone to support the euro. \par \par \uc2  "We took necessary action overseas yesterday for the sake of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stability... Our stance that we will continue taking decisive steps if needed has not changed," Usui said on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  He declined to say which \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  the BOJ sold for yen in Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  overseas. \par \par \uc2  Bankers in Tokyo said the BOJ bought euros for yen in European trading hours on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ bought dollars against the yen in Tokyo on Wednesday morning following the yen's rise to five-week highs versus the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ acts as agent of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  under the guidance of the Finance Ministry. \par \par \uc2  Usui also declined to elaborate on reasons for the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  ((Yuko Yoshikawa, Tokyo Newsroom +81-3 3432 8022 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw3904pcw\pa