\par\par \b \uc2  JGBs gain on Nikkei fall, but activity subdued. \b0\par\par\uc2 541 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2000\par 08:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, March 8 (Reuters) - Japanese government bond (JGB) cash and futures prices were higher in Tokyo late on Wednesday, receiving a boost from a drop in Tokyo share prices. \par \par \uc2  But activity remained slow as most investors were reluctant to trade actively ahead of the end-March fiscal year-end. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The key June 10-year JGB futures\tab     closed up 0.41 point at 131.74, after trading between 131.56 and 131.77. Turnover was 63,308 lots.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The Nikkei is still struggling near 20,000. That's supportive for JGBs, as further stock price rises could help lift business and consumer sentiment," said a trader at a Japanese brokerage.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Tokyo's key Nikkei average\tab    ended down 177.44 points or 0.89 percent at 19,766.80, following a 3.68 percent overnight drop in the Dow Jones industrial average to its lowest level in nearly a year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Traders said some investor buying was detected in the long-end of the yield curve in morning trade, but the cash JGB market was quiet throughout the afternoon session.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The yield of the March 1.8 percent 10-year 219th JGB\tab \tab     was at 1.745 percent at 0645 GMT, down from 1.780 percent late on Tuesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The yen's drop after the Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's (BOJ) \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had a limited impact on the JGB market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The BOJ's action helped push the dollar as high as 107.50 yen in morning trade, up nearly two yen from a five-week low of 105.78 yen set overnight.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "I don't think the JGB market would be affected by exchange rate moves unless the dollar moves out of the 105-110 yen range," said a trader at a European brokerage.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Traders said the key near-term event for the JGB market was the release next Monday of Japan's gross domestic product data for October-December. A Reuters poll of 19 economists last week produced a median forecast of a 1.1 percent quarter-on-quarter drop.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Traders said the market would be watching whether Japan's October-December corporate capital spending data, to be released on Thursday, would prompt economists revise their GDP forecasts.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Predictions by five institutions surveyed by Reuters ranged from a drop of one percent to a drop of six percent, after a 9.6 percent fall in the July-September period.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ministry of Finance\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is scheduled to hold an auction of 500 billion yen worth of six-year JGBs on Thursday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Traders said the market would probably easily absorb the new bonds, as the offer amount was halved from 1.0 trillion yen at the previous six-year bond offering.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The MOF's auction of 3.3 trillion yen of three-month financing bills on Wednesday produced a lowest accepted price of 99.987, with 69.1885 percent of the bids accepted at that price.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par As expected, the BOJ said its Policy Board decided on Wednesday by a majority vote to maintain its zero interest rate policy. The outcome was announced after the JGB futures market closed. ((Kanta Watanabe, Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3 3432 9780 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 2000.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw38053xi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
