\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Yen ends broadly lower after BoJ  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2      By Genevieve Wilkinson \par \uc2 583 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2000\par 23:06\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      NEW YORK, March 8 (Reuters) - The yen fell against the euro \par \par \uc2  and dollar on Wednesday after Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold its own \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help break the yen's quick pace of recent gains. \par \par \uc2      The Bank of Japan surprised the market overnight, buying \par \par \uc2  dollars for yen for the second time this year. \par \par \uc2      Ordered by Tokyo's Finance Minister Kiichi Miyazawa, the \par \par \uc2  move was aimed at soothing the yen's rapid ascent brought on in \par \par \uc2  part with a sudden crush to repatriate funds ahead of the end \par \par \uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's financial year on March 31. \par \par \uc2      With the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , authorities drove the yen as low as \par \par \uc2  107.45 yen per dollar and 103.19 yen to the euro. \par \par \uc2      Although the yen had pared some of its losses by the end of \par \par \uc2  New York trading it closed down more than a full percent \par \par \uc2  against both the dollar and the yen amid ongoing nervousness \par \par \uc2  that there may be more \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action ahead. \par \par \uc2  "I would think this \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not a one-off thing," \par \par \uc2  said Seth Garrett, global head of spot trading at Credit Suisse \par \par \uc2  First Boston. \par \par \uc2  Japanese officials have feared that a sharp rise in the yen \par \par \uc2  may choke off the nation's fragile economic recovery. Yet hopes \par \par \uc2  that recovery may pick up speed soon has contributed to reasons \par \par \uc2  to buy Japanese assets and the yen. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile the euro also gained some ground against the \par \par \uc2  dollar, raising itself off a week low at 95.24 cents to stand \par \par \uc2  0.09 percent higher against the dollar at 96.05 cents at the \par \par \uc2  close of New York trading. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said investors had taken profits and remained \par \par \uc2  worried by the prospects for U.S. equities. \par \par \uc2      Even though the Dow Jones industrial average and technology \par \par \uc2  heavy Nasdaq composite index both bounced back on Wednesday, \par \par \uc2  their sharp losses on Tuesday still worried the market. \par \par \uc2      European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Vice President Christian Noyer helped \par \par \uc2  the euro a touch by saying the 11-nation's growth rate could \par \par \uc2  top 3 percent this year, which is above many analysts' 2.5 \par \par \uc2  percent growth rates. \par \par \uc2  However analysts remained concerned about the euro's \par \par \uc2  general health because it failed to gain significant momentum \par \par \uc2  when Germany's unemployment rate fell for the fifth consecutive \par \par \uc2  month. Instead traders focused on less positive news showing \par \par \uc2  that German manufacturing was weaker than expected in January. \par \par \uc2  For now some dealers expect the euro will trade sideways \par \par \uc2  but some analysts said a fall to 92 cents, which would mark \par \par \uc2  fresh life lows, is possible. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid prices at 2201GMT. All data taken from \par \par \uc2  Reuters \par \par \uc2  with percent change calculated from the daily U.S. \par \par \uc2  close at 2130GMT. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab \tab    US Close US Close  %Chg   YTD %  1999\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Cls\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab \tab    08 Mar.  07 Mar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -------------------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Euro/dlr\tab \tab    0.9605   0.9596   +0.09   -4.71   1.0070\par Dlr/yen\tab \tab     107.21   106.07   +1.07   +3.78   102.21\par Euro/yen\tab \tab    102.98   101.77   +1.19   -1.29   103.10\par Dlr/swiss\tab \tab   1.6716   1.6744   -0.17   +5.29   1.5902\par Stg/dlr\tab \tab     1.5803   1.5793   +0.06   -2.37   1.6176\par Dlr/can\tab \tab     1.4561   1.4544   +0.12   +0.62   1.4455\par Aus/dlr\tab \tab     0.6086   0.6055   +0.51   -7.74   0.6563\par Euro/swiss\tab \tab  1.6062   1.6071   -0.06   +0.22   1.6036\par Euro/stg\tab \tab    0.6073   0.6060   +0.21   -2.87   0.6239.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 2000.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw3804nvd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
