\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -2: BOJ Fears Support Euro Vs Yen \b0\par\par\uc2 377 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2000\par 07:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Together with the dollar's ability to hold above key support at Y106.50 - despite several attempts by market players to push it lower in recent sessions, the U.S \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rebound has generated speculation that its next move can only be up. \par \par \uc2  Patterns on candlestick charts also suggest the dollar's downside is firm, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "At this point, the dollar has built a base," said a Japanese city bank dealer. Initial support is pegged at Y107.20. \par \par \uc2  But traders said that Japanese players may resume their yen buying \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the coming sessions, putting the dollar and the euro under pressure once again. \par \par \uc2  "Unless there are new factors to buy the euro, it's going to be pretty weak (against the yen) for the rest of March," Commerzbank's Muramatsu said. \par \par \uc2  However, fear that Japanese financial authorities will come to the euro's rescue is putting a floor under the European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Initial support is pegged at Y102.45, with firm support at the euro's all-time low of Y102.05, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Traders said they suspect that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  would likely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the euro against the yen if market players tried to push the pair to new record lows, as a meltdown in that pair could would likely put massive downward pressure on the dollar-yen, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The euro-yen should be weak, but fear of BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is providing support," ABN AMRO's Takano said. \par \par \uc2  Late in Tokyo, the euro was quoted at Y103.37, up from Y103.06 in New York late Monday. The euro was at Y102.95 in Tokyo late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Sterling was at $1.5745, flat from $1.5747 in New York late Monday. Sterling was at $1.5815 in Tokyo late Monday. \par \par \uc2  -By Arran Scott; 813-5255-2929; arran.scott@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  The chart of late Tokyo \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates which accompanied Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been replaced with an enhanced \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixture which is updated hourly. \par \par \uc2  Subscribers can find this table: \par \par \uc2  -On Telerate pages 4046 and 1087. \par \par \uc2  -On Dow Jones Newswires by searching the code N/IFX \par \par \uc2  -On Reuters by entering FRX or INT \par \par \uc2  -On Bloomberg by entering NI FRX \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw37018tv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
