\par\par \b \uc2  DAVOS: ECB Should Prop Euro - Nobel Laureate Mundell \b0\par\par\uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Januar 2000\par 18:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  DAVOS, Switzerland -(Dow Jones)- The European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to shore up the weakening euro, Nobel prize laureate economist Robert Mundell said Friday at the annual World Economic Forum meeting here. \par \par \uc2  "My argument is that the ECB should \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange market, both spot and forward, in order to maintain its goal of price stability," Mundell said. "If the euro goes down further, this will further put pressure on raw material prices and start to ignite increasing (interest) rate pressures." \par \par \uc2  Mundell is a professor of economics at School of International and Public Affairs at New York's Columbia University. \par \par \uc2  Euro weakness compounded by higher resource prices would force the ECB to tackle inflationary pressures anyway, without taking the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  into consideration, Mundell said. \par \par \uc2  The ECB, he said, falsely believes that its mandate is limited to maintaining price stability, leaving exchange rate decisions to euro-zone finance ministers. \par \par \uc2  Asked whether the ECB should seek a concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the euro, Mundell said: "(The ECB) could do it on its own if it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the forward market and if it's unsterilized." \par \par \uc2  However, the ECB should seek a support of Japan and the U.S. to strengthen the euro, he said. \par \par \uc2  "I think it's much better to get the cooperation with \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the United States...in the long-run \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is going have to be a cooperative thing because all three countries, at least in the bilateral sense the United States and Europe, are both involved in it," Mundell said. \par \par \uc2  -By Leos Rousek; 7-095-761-7525; lrousek@ap.org \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw1s00mpa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
