\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : Dlr-Yen Flat After Posting Fresh 6-Week High \b0\par\par\uc2  By Chang-Ran Kim \par \uc2 783 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 2000\par 06:41\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO -(Dow Jones)- The dollar attracted all kinds of buyers Thursday in Asia who fired the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  comfortably past Wednesday's six-week high against the yen, but it settled back to late New York levels as exporter selling and profit-taking emerged. \par \par \uc2  Once trading opened in Tokyo, the dollar resumed its upward march against the yen to touch an intraday high of Y104.66, above Wednesday's high of Y104.37 set in New York. \par \par \uc2  Dealers attributed a large portion of the purchases to overseas investors - in particular U.S. players - who apparently cashed in on their Japanese equity holdings and bought dollars back. \par \par \uc2  Buying interest was also present from Japanese players including life insurers and investment trust funds, dealers said. The same players were said to have bought euros for yen as well, some of them with the intention of shifting attention away from the Asian asset market on the back of strong economic data out of the eurozone. The single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  climbed as high as Y108.08 this session, compared to around Y103 three days ago. \par \par \uc2  However, Japanese exporters' selling prevailed in the end, with some help from interbank profit-taking, dragging the dollar back to late New York levels. \par \par \uc2  "We haven't seen the Y104 level in a while, and exporters are naturally going to want to sell at these levels," said a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at a Japanese trust bank. \par \par \uc2  Given the still-rampant interest among exporters to sell off dollars, however, "it's surprising that the dollar's still up (on the day)," said a senior dealer at a Japanese long-term credit bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that Y105.00 is a key psychological level, and while exporter selling will likely continue to slow the dollar's charges, a break past that level could herald a reverse in the yen-strengthening trend. \par \par \uc2  "If Y105 is broken, we could enter a totally different arena," said the trust bank manager. \par \par \uc2  At 0515 GMT (12:15 a.m. EST), the dollar was quoted at Y104.25, flat from late Wednesday in New York. The dollar was at 102.96 late Wednesday in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The euro was at $1.0347, higher than $1.0320 late Wednesday in New\par York. The euro was at $1.0313 in Tokyo Wednesday.\par -0- 06/01/00 05-41G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Many market watchers note that as the dollar's trading range is\par shifting upward against the yen even as it weakens against other major\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been quite\par effective.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The effects of the actual \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  have also been invigorated by\par verbal backing from Finance Ministry officials.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par For instance, in a rare interview published Wednesday in Japan's\par leading financial newspaper, Haruhiko Kuroda, the vice finance minister\par for international affairs, stressed that the ministry's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par policy isn't limited to smoothing out disruptive moves in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Kuroda said of Tuesday's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 : "By acting in the market, we\par corrected an overshooting in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rates. But it's not the case that\par we only aim to calm rough moves in the market. Depending on conditions,\par we will cooperate with (other Group of Seven nations) or act on our own\par to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . And when we act, we will act boldly."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Kuroda, as well as the ministry's international bureau head Zembei\par Mizoguchi, also said that the yen was still "too strong" when the dollar\par was buying around Y104.20. Mizoguchi also told reporters Thursday that\par "a further correction to the excessively strong yen is desirable."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The fact that the dollar has risen only against the yen and fallen\par against other \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  shows that the market is taking \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par fears rather seriously," said a dealer at a Japanese trust bank.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par After the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  made its presence clear on the first trading\par day of the year, and in light of all the official jawboning, "it's\par become more difficult to sell the dollar," said a trader at a European\par bank in Tokyo.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par However, most dealers said that current moves aren't enough to declare\par that the dollar is on a concrete upward track against the yen, and that\par much of its gains stems from the euro's strength versus the dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Against the yen, the euro was quoted at Y107.87, up from Y107.59 in\par New York late Wednesday. The euro was at Y106.18 in Tokyo late\par Wednesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Sterling was at $1.6443, up from $1.6425 in New York late Wednesday.\par Sterling was at $1.6375 in Tokyo late Wednesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Chang-Ran Kim; 813-5255-2929; chang-ran.kim@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1074 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw16002ag\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
