\par\par \b \uc2  Japan foreign reserves rise to $288.080 bln in Dec. \b0\par\par\uc2 447 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Januar 2000\par 10:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Jan 5 (Reuters) - Japan's foreign reserves rose to $288.080 billion at the end of December, up $16.121 billion from a month earlier, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) said on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Reserves at the end of November were $271.959 billion, down $799 million from the previous month. \par \par \uc2  Foreign reserves acquired through \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the end of November and on Christmas Eve were included in the December figure. \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  settlements are made two business days after the transaction. \par \par \uc2  The ministry has confirmed that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars for yen, using the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  as an agent, on November 29 and November 30. Bankers said the BOJ was also detected buying euros against the yen on both dates. \par \par \uc2  The ministry has also confirmed that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars for yen on December 24. \par \par \uc2  Foreign reserves fluctuate from month to month due to factors such as \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, income from interest and fluctuations in the dollar value of foreign reserve assets. \par \par \uc2  A ministry official said the rise in foreign reserves in December was due partly to foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but added that the ministry cannot disclose \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  amounts. The official also said \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign reserves rose by a record $72.131 billion in 1999. ((Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3 5473 3748 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  Reserves at the end of November were $271.959 billion, down $799 million from the previous month. \par \par \uc2  Foreign reserves acquired through \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the end of November and on Christmas Eve were included in the December figure. \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  settlements are made two business days after the transaction. \par \par \uc2  The ministry has confirmed that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars for yen, using the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  as an agent, on November 29 and November 30. Bankers said the BOJ was also detected buying euros against the yen on both dates. \par \par \uc2  The ministry has also confirmed that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars for yen on December 24. \par \par \uc2  Foreign reserves fluctuate from month to month due to factors such as \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, income from interest and fluctuations in the dollar value of foreign reserve assets. ((Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3 3432-8027 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  A ministry official said the rise in foreign reserves in December was due partly to foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but added that the ministry cannot disclose \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  amounts. The official also said \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign reserves rose by a record $72.131 billion in 1999. \par \par \uc2  ((Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3 5473 3748 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw15082eu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pi