\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dlr recovers above Y102 on BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Risa Maeda \par \uc2 836 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Januar 2000\par 08:18\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Jan 4 (Reuters) - Repeated rounds of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) pushed the dollar above 102 yen on Tuesday in Tokyo after the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  took its cue from gains in Tokyo stocks and began the New Year on a strong note. \par \par \uc2  The yen, supported by expectations of economic recovery in Japan this year, buoyant stock prices and exporter dollar sales, came within a whisker of a four-year high against the dollar on Tuesday before running into selling by the BOJ. \par \par \uc2  The dollar had sagged to 101.46 yen before the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  began its support with its bids detected from around 101.70 yen. By 0630 GMT, the dollar was resting at 102.24/34 yen after rising briefly to 102.73. \par \par \uc2  In late New York on Monday the dollar stood at 101.56 yen, down from 102.05 late here on Thursday ahead of the holidays. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said thin market volumes on Tokyo's first trading of the New Year exaggerated the impact of dollar buying by the BOJ, which \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  on behalf of the Finance Ministry. \par \par \uc2  "The BOJ stepped in today as it had to absorb (dollar) selling orders for now," said a senior European bank dealer. \par \par \uc2  But despite the fact that trading got off with no technical Y2K bug-related glitches, many bankers and their customers have taken to the sidelines this week due to Y2K concerns. \par \par \uc2  The Finance Ministry was quick to confirm this morning's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's top \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  official Haruhiko Kuroda warned that authorities stood ready to act as necessary. \par \par \uc2  "We looked at the market's condition this morning and acted," Kuroda told reporters. "We will continue to watch the (\b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) market carefully and will act decisively as necessary." \par \par \uc2  But despite those words, the dollar again faltered toward 102 yen in the afternoon, setting off further BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Against the dollar, the euro\tab   held on to most of its hefty overnight gains to stand at $1.0228/36 as of 0650 GMT, having leapt to $1.0262 in late U.S. trade.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Kuroda declined to comment on whether the BOJ \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market in Tuesday afternoon.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par It was the third time the BOJ has blocked the yen's rise to 101.00 to the dollar since last November when the yen hit a four-year high of 101.25.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But unlike the previous \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at the end of November and on Christmas Eve, the Finance Ministry seemed hesitant to push up the dollar further above 103 yen this time, dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par That was probably because it was waiting for market liquidity to increase later this month when wariness over Y2K problems will wane, some dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Some others say that the Japanese authorities found it more difficult to rein in the yen's rise now that the Japanese stock market rallied on hopes for a brighter economic outlook.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Tokyo's benchmark Nikkei 225 share index jumped 250 points at one stage on Tuesday morning to as high as 19,187, its highest level since August 1997.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A flood of foreign funds into the underweighted Japanese equity market was a major contributing factor to the yen's broad based appreciation last year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "They seem to be aware it would difficult to push up the dollar only by themselves," said Mitsumaru Kumagai, senior market analyst at Industrial Bank of Japan.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Kumagai said given higher Japanese stock prices, the yen is naturally in an uptrend, while \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  could only provide a chance for foreign investors to buy stocks at bargain prices.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Also, there seemed fewer supporters for aggressive dollar-buying yen-selling \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  than before as a growing number of government officials have recently shown optimistic views over the economy, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The euro, meanwhile, had been supported by a string of upbeat economic data from Europe, the latest being a strong Purchasing Management survey for December released on Monday. ((Tokyo Treasury Desk, +81-3-3432-8570 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  bid prices at 0707 GMT.  All data taken from Reuters\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par with percent change calculated from the daily U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par close at 2130 GMT.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab \tab      Last     US Close  % Chg  YTD %   1999 Cls\par \tab \tab \tab \tab \tab   03 Jan.\par \tab \tab \tab      -----------------------------------------\par  Euro/dlr\tab \tab     1.0227   1.0262   -0.34    +1.56   1.0070\par  Dlr/yen\tab \tab      102.44   101.56   +0.87    +0.23   102.21\par  Euro/yen\tab \tab     104.77   104.09   +0.65    +1.62   103.10\par  Dlr/swiss\tab \tab    1.5676   1.5645   +0.20    -1.42   1.5902\par  Stg/dlr\tab \tab      1.6331   1.6368   -0.23    +0.96   1.6176\par  Can/dlr\tab \tab      1.4460   1.4461   -0.01    +0.03   1.4455\par  Aus/dlr\tab \tab      0.6578   0.6579   -0.02    +0.23   0.6563\par  Euro/swiss\tab \tab   1.6039   1.6045   -0.04    +0.02   1.6036\par  Euro/stg\tab \tab     0.6261   0.6261   +0.00    +0.35   0.6239.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 2000.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010822dw1401hv1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
